  "description": "Redington Woods, Clarinbridge – Two Exclusive New A-Rated Homes\n\nKeane Mahony Smith and joint agents Gill & Glynn offer an exciting opportunity to acquire one of just two exceptional new homes at Redington Woods, Clarinbridge offering high-quality construction, generous private sites and energy-efficient modern living.\n\nSite 15A: c. 1,000 sq. m. / 0.25 acre\nSite 15B: c. 1,574 sq. m. / 0.39 acre\n\nBoth homes will achieve an A-rated BER and are covered by a 10-Year HomeBond Guarantee. \n\nEstimated completion May 2027\n\nKey Specifications\n\nThe homes will be finished to a high standard and will include:\n\n•\tBlockwork construction with Hollowcore flooring at first-floor level\n•\tAir-to-water heat pump system\n•\tUnderfloor heating to ground and first floors\n•\tHigh-performance double-glazed windows\n•\tBespoke fitted kitchen with €30,000 PC Sum\n•\tUtility/laundry and master bedroom walk-in wardrobes with €10,000 PC Sum\n•\tTiling allowance of €12,000 PC Sum\n•\tContemporary bathrooms and en-suites with quality sanitary ware\n•\tBespoke painted staircase with stained oak bannister\n•\tPainted internal finish throughout\n•\tLandscaped front and rear gardens with patio area\n•\tEV charging point\n•\tWired for intruder alarm\n•\tLow-maintenance external render with decorative detailing and natural granite door surround\n\nTotal PC Sum Allowances: €52,000.\n\nThese substantial new homes offer an excellent combination of space, quality, energy efficiency and generous gardens, with purchasers benefiting from an impressive specification and substantial allowances to personalise the internal finish.\n\nPlease contact the auctioneer for further details on these exclusive properties",
